{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/numvjvLIPCDFGeApy8cfdQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:15.875829+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/numvjvLIPCDFGeApy8cfdQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WejMHnpIOiadxYzoEcXc6p6BNPyhb0pPTf1mJgiblLLs6CVNL15F1YEt39bItXDRGamBp9ib9Nw3RPPUHFYUr0lKyhZGrqjjLV5HLINxK3xqD8/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海交通大学人工智能学院2027年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名系统将于2026年</span><span><strong><span>9月8日-9月11日</span></strong></span><span>期间开放。欢迎全国优秀学子踊跃报名。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>上海交通大学人工智能学院(School of Artificial Intelligence, SJTU SAI)正式成立于2024年4月，是学校顺应发展趋势、对接国家战略，服务城市先导产业而成立的实体学院。学院通过高层次定位和全新体制机制，致力于培养中国自主的人工智能拔尖人才，为国家高水平科技自立自强提供有力支撑。学院起点高、基础厚、要求严、重实践，为上海交通大学百年徐汇校区注入了全新的活力。</span></p><p><span>为进一步增进全国高校优秀大学生对上海交通大学人工智能学院的了解，现开展2027级研究生推荐免试直升研究生招生活动，欢迎对人工智能研究有浓厚兴趣的优秀本科三年级在校生踊跃报名！</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2. 诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录；</span></p><p><span>3. 健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准；</span></p><p><span>4. 有志于从事人工智能前沿领域学术研究相关学科（人工智能、计算机、电子信息、自动化、数学、物理等）的本科三年级学生。一般应为“双一流”建设高校在读，大学前三年成绩专业排名前20%。属于教育部基础学科拔尖学生培养计划2.0基地拔尖班的同学或在研究方面表现特别突出者，可适当放宽条件；</span></p><p><span>5. 英语水平需达到：CET6≥425或TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0；</span></p><p><span>6. 能够获得所在学校的推免资格；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>特别优秀者第4条可适当放宽（如发表高水平论文、竞赛获奖等）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>招生专业目录</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/WejMHnpIOiacHoK2ic1JOY2TxOIOcG7qPfZe7CoWNYSWF9Bjk4ID0ODibFmqe5M4DhjV84t9hs6Ed9k841u80rvicNtogibyzmfb64pSexCHt778/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>*说明：140500智能科学与技术为学术学位，085400电子信息为专业学位。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请材料</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>9月11日前</span></strong><span>登录上海交通大学优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生网报系统进行报名（网址：https://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/ytmgl/）。在报名系统中需上传以下申请材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证和学生证；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请表（文末下载，签名部分手写）；</span></p><p><span>（3）个人简历（主要介绍本科期间的科研经历和体会，不超过2页A4纸，字数不限)；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科成绩单（需所在学校或院系的教务部门盖章证明）；</span></p><p><span>（5）专业排名证明（需所在学校或院系的教务部门盖章证明）；</span></p><p><span>（6）英语六级成绩或TOEFL、IELTS成绩证明；</span></p><p><span>（7）其他各类获奖证书、发表论文、科研成果等体现个人综合素质和学术水平的材料。</span></p><p><span>（8）个人简历。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>*报名考生须提供真实有效的报名材料，如有弄虚作假，一经查证，即刻取消报名资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>选拔考核流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.初审：招生工作小组根据申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等，确定入围资格，将通过电子邮件通知入围学生，并在学校研招网公示名单。请确保在报名系统中填写的邮箱和手机号码正确，并保持联系方式畅通。</span></p><p><span>2.学生反馈：初审通过的同学，须按邮件要求反馈是否参加复试，逾期不反馈者视为放弃参加复试。</span></p><p><span>3.复试：具体安排将通过邮件通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 本办法由人工智能学院负责解释，如有与教育部和学校相关政策不一致处，以教育部和学校政策为准。</span></p><p><span>2. 其他相关要求按《上海交通大学2027年招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博）办法》执行。</span></p><p><span>3. 联系方式：aischool@sjtu.edu.cn，021-33687205</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>附件：</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/numvjvLIPCDFGeApy8cfdQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>上海交通大学人工智能学院2027级推荐免试直升研究生选拔活动申请表.docx</span></a></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>供稿：人才培养办公室</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WejMHnpIOiaft9pOw1ibXqxbgZ3gg5wibjoHCtpxqicmlaJQOibVX1LjoicgEuOCMl2tGGJ0lyb64icuviaibZ3aBlWdhwLFsbmYibYfWRErmXNBegtfc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cf94f42aa6c68969820fd2be55742c9fc4b981e0e2cf1c20ab78be0b764307b5","textLength":1431,"sourceSha256":"aae62215fae84c263c34d9672f9ac43a775160e8f07b8b5709fb245ba886c1fc","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fe1535286b3c87194ef2","title":"2026年上海交通大学人工智能学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预推免欢迎全国优秀学子踊跃报名","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:15.875829+00:00"}
